---
source: crates/rustman-cli/src/tests.rs
expression: help
---
List exchanges, newest first: id, time, method, URL, status and total ms

Usage: rustman history list [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --status <CODE|CLASS>
          Only exchanges with this status code (404) or class (5xx)

      --method <METHOD>
          Only exchanges with this method

      --grep <TEXT>
          Only exchanges whose URL, request body or response body contains TEXT (ignoring case)

      --since <DURATION>
          Only exchanges from the last DURATION: 30s, 15m, 1h, 2d or 1w

      --limit <N>
          Show at most N exchanges (at least 1)

      --workspace <DIR>
          Workspace directory (default: search from the current directory upwards; outside any workspace, the ad-hoc history)

      --json
          Print a JSON array instead of one line per exchange

      --color <WHEN>
          Color: auto (a terminal without NO_COLOR or TERM=dumb), always or never
          
          [default: auto]

  -v, --verbose...
          Log more on stderr: -v requests, -vv headers, -vvv everything (RUST_LOG, when set, replaces these levels)

  -h, --help
          Print help
